  "policy_quote": "The `incident_date` must be the date stated by the policyholder, in YYYY-MM-DD format.",
  "evidence_quote": "→ TOOL_CALL file_claim: {\"policy_id\": \"HM-448120\", \"incident_date\": \"2025-03-13\", \"peril\": \"wind\", \"description\": \"Part of the roof torn off by wind.\"}",
  "analysis": "The user explicitly stated the incident date as **3 марта 2025 года** (March 3, 2025) in **h6**, which corresponds to **2025-03-03**. The assistant's `file_claim` call incorrectly uses **2025-03-13** instead. The policy requires the exact date provided by the user, and no exceptions apply here.",
  "verdict": "SUPPORTED"
}
